  "sourceTitle": "Home Canned Stewed Tomatoes",
  "sourceText": "Home Canned Stewed Tomatoes\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 9, 2009 - 11:36pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nTomatoes\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n1 teaspoon sugar\n1/4 cup chopped celery\n1/4 cup chopped onions\n1/8 cup chopped green peppers\n1/4 cup chopped carrots\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Fill the quart jars with peeled tomatoes, add salt, sugar, celery, onions, peppers and carrots. Seal and cook in water bath for 1 1/2 hours. Good for hot dishes, chilies, soups, etc.",
